  "question": {
    "text": "The number of words (with or without meaning) that can be formed from all the letters of the word<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#34;</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>&#34;</mo></math> in which vowels never come together is....."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "120",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>&nbsp;Consonants are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math></p><p>Vowels are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>,</mo></math></p><p>Total number of words (without meaning) from letters of word&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#39;</mo><mi>LETTER</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>180</mn></math></p><p>Total number of words (with or without meaning) from letters of word&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#39;</mo><mi>LETTER</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></math>&nbsp;if vowels are together&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;Required&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>180</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn></math></p>"
